#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:333
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The rescue environment will now attempt to find your Linux installation and "
"mount it under the directory : %s.  You can then make any changes required "
"to your system.  Choose '1' to proceed with this step.\n"
"You can choose to mount your file systems read-only instead of read-write by "
"choosing '2'.\n"
"If for some reason this process does not work choose '3' to skip directly to "
"a shell.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Redningsmiljøet prøver no å finne Linux-installasjonen din og montere han "
"under mappa %s.  Deretter kan du gjere dei endringane systemet treng.  Vel "
"«1» for å gå vidare med dette steget.\n"
"Vel «2» om du vil montere filsystema skriveverna i staden for med lese- og "
"skrivetilgang.\n"
"Om dette av ein eller annan grunn ikkje fungerer, vel du «3» for å gå rett "
"til eit skal.\n"
"\n"

#: pyanaconda/ui/gui/spokes/root_password.glade:73
msgid ""
"The root account is used for administering the system.\n"
"\n"
"The root user (also known as super user) has complete access to the entire "
"system. For this reason, logging into this system as the root user is best "
"done only to perform system maintenance or administration."
msgstr ""
"Root-kontoen vert brukt til å administrere systemet.\n"
"\n"
"Root-brukaren (òg kalla superbrukar) har full tilgang til heile systemet. "
"Difor bør du berre logge inn som root-brukar når du skal vedlikehalde eller "
"administrere systemet."

